Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 10:33:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250: describe OnePlus 8 Pro
 haptics and flash LEDs

Add kernel patches 0074-0076: describe stock haptics and flash wiring,
and leave the mismatched secondary charge-pump driver disabled. Advance
to release 70.

Signed-off-by: Roman Kuraev <naoru.desu@gmail.com>
---
